.Dd October 22, 2026
.Dt NOHUP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nohup
.Nd invoke a command immune to hangups
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
invokes
.Ar command
and ignores the signals
.Dv SIGHUP
and
.Dv SIGQUIT .
.Pp
if stdout is a terminal, the stdout is appended to
.Pa nohup.out .
if stderr is a terminal, it is also redirected to
.Pa nohup.out .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
